S at constant exchange rates, we have raised our outlook to about $1.33 to $1.34, and this compares to the prior range of $1.31 to $1.33.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/30/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2018 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2019-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"…if you just go down the list from Brexit, from things in Italy, from, again, Turkey to see the tariff discussion, if you see potential shutdowns in US, there's a lot of things, which in general, can happen. There's probably also one of reasons why I would say we guided Q1 as we guided for it,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2018 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"And I think, the other thing what most people do not see what clearly is an important factor for us, as well as it's quite obvious that the restructuring related charges are going down for us quite significantly over the time going forward, and that clearly has a cash impact as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2018 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peer Schatz","x":"If we can offer cost-saving products like QuantiFERON and others, they provide -- and especially NeuMoDx provides significant cost savings, this is something that I think should bode well, but we're being cautious.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peer Schatz","x":"In next-generation sequencing, we launched new solutions for customers to streamline NGS analysis and interpretation by integrating our cutting edge bioinformatics solutions with pre-configured QIAseq DNA panels or custom panels for use on any sequencing platform as well as QIAact panels on the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/qiagen-nv-qgen-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Peer Schatz","x":"Even though we are seeing some challenging macro trends especially in Europe and we have a lot to do in terms of execution on our growth opportunities, our teams are performing well and our strategic initiatives are well on track and we are reaffirming our outlook for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/qiagen-nv-qgen-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Peer Schatz","x":"As a fourth point we are reaffirming our outlook for 2019 to deliver faster sales growth along with improvements in adjusted earnings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/qiagen-nv-qgen-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"As noted earlier, we have updated our outlook for total net sales growth of approximately 5% to 6% CER growth reflecting the lower sales growth due to the restructuring of the clinical sequencing NGS joint venture in China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/qiagen-nv-qgen-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2019-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tycho Peterson","x":"Obviously, you reiterated the guidance that the June 20th, Analyst Day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/qiagen-nv-qgen-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"I would like to provide some more details on the restructuring charges that are being taken primarily in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"As a result of these initiatives, we have taken a pre-tax restructuring charge of $276.8 million in operating results for the third quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2020-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"Pass it on to you, Thierry?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"As we mentioned earlier, we announced an approval that restructuring charges would be taken primarily in the third and fourth quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2019 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"As a result of these initiatives, we took a pre-tax restructuring charge of $24.9 million on operating income for the fourth quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QGEN 2020 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"Also keep in mind, that we had about $126 million of payments in 2020 for the discontinued tender offer, and also about $52 million of cash payout in 2020 for the restructuring measures initiated in October 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2020 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2021-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"As noted earlier, we are reaffirming the full-year outlook previously announced in December 2020 for net sales to about 18% to 20% CER growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2020 Q4","e":"qgen","d":"2021-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"And as a last point, we are reaffirming our 2021 outlook for both sales growth and adjusted EPS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/qiagen-nv-qgen-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2021 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"And as a final key message, we are reaffirming our full-year outlook for 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/qiagen-nv-qgen-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2021 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"And as a last point, we are reaffirming our outlook for sale and adjusted EPS growth in '21, anchored by improving trends in non-COVID product groups, as we also continue to serve customers as the pandemic evolves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/qiagen-nv-qgen-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2021 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"You know that we have always been very clear, Roland and I, over the last call to say that QIAGEN has a very controlled policy as regard to price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2021 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"It's not only making sure that you are passing price increase, but it's also monitoring the discounts that you are doing during the rest of the year because discount happen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2021 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Gilardi","x":"We have decided to streamline the prepared comments and want to have more time to address your questions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2021 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"Also, the third year -- the prior year period included total cash payment of USD190 million for costs related to the discontinued tender offer and USD50 million of cash payments for restructuring activities, that were initiated in late 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/qiagen-nv-qgen-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"Despite currency headwinds and the adverse impact of tariffs and the current US government shutdown, we continue to improve profitability and maintain solid growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"Our adjusted operating income margin for 2025 was steady at 29.6% of sales, 30% at constant exchange rates, absorbing more than 150 basis points of headwinds from currency movements and the impact of US tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eisenor","x":"…that, on the pricing dynamics, these tariffs surcharges, you're placing on your products, we're hearing from some of your peers that there could be some resistance to the surcharges that are being passed through and potentially resulting in some delay or push out of demand into the next quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eisenor","x":"Just curious, is this something you're seeing or are you comfortable that these surcharges are passing through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"Third, cash generation was also strong with underlying operating cash flow of $466 million for the nine months of 2025, including about $45 million cash restructuring payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"But the 2025 results included about $45 million of cash restructuring payments related to the efficiency and portfolio initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"For the full year, we are reaffirming our outlook for total net sales growth of about 4% to 5% at 5% to 6% CER since this excludes sales from discontinued products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2025 Q3","e":"qgen","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"And I remind you, Casey, in that environment, unlike many competitors or peers, we have maintained our guidance for the year top line, and we have also improved our guidance from a profitability standpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/qiagen-qgen-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"And third, a unique and clearly only possible for Qiagen N.V. because of 20 years of test data, a unique AI investment to help doctors determining tomorrow who in the whole population of latent TB patients has the highest score to move to active TB.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/qiagen-qgen-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q1","e":"qgen","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nadia Albrecht","x":"Qiagen N.V. has been investing in automation for several years, partnering with companies such as Tecan and Hamilton to streamline pre-analytical steps, with DiaSorin to automate the detection on the LIAISON platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/qiagen-qgen-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"On the topic of tariff repayments, we foresee for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/qiagen-qgen-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"This was achieved despite approximately $20 million of cash payments for efficiency and restructuring programs and a planned increase in inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/qiagen-qgen-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tycho Peterson","x":"Is it restructuring?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/qiagen-qgen-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thierry Bernard","x":"We are reaffirming our full year outlook and remain confident in stronger growth during the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/qiagen-qgen-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QGEN 2026 Q2","e":"qgen","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roland Sackers","x":"For the full year, we are reaffirming our outlook for total net sales growth of about 1 to 2 percentage points at CER.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/qiagen-qgen-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,10788,0,0,0,9443,886],[36,1,9617,0,0,0,8046,1173],[37,1,11079,0,0,0,10164,575],[38,1,9291,0,0,0,8225,747],[39,1,10518,0,0,0,9645,568],[40,1,9439,0,0,0,8190,967],[44,1,8807,0,0,0,7354,1107],[45,1,9585,0,0,0,8361,920],[47,1,7908,0,0,0,6609,964],[63,1,8077,0,0,0,7937,0],[65,1,6963,0,0,0,6804,0],[66,1,7664,0,0,0,6230,1106]],"cinema":[[35,1,10788,0,0,0,9443,886],[36,1,9617,0,0,0,8046,1173],[37,1,11079,0,0,0,10164,575],[38,1,9291,0,0,0,8225,747],[39,1,10518,0,0,0,9645,568],[40,1,9439,0,0,0,8190,967],[44,1,8807,0,0,0,7354,1107],[45,1,9585,0,0,0,8361,920],[47,1,7908,0,0,0,6609,964],[63,1,8077,0,0,0,7937,0],[65,1,6963,0,0,0,6804,0],[66,1,7664,0,0,0,6230,1106]],"imax":[[35,1,10788,0,0,0,9443,886],[36,1,9617,0,0,0,8046,1173],[37,1,11079,0,0,0,10164,575],[38,1,9291,0,0,0,8225,747],[39,1,10518,0,0,0,9645,568],[40,1,9439,0,0,0,8190,967],[44,1,8807,0,0,0,7354,1107],[45,1,9585,0,0,0,8361,920],[47,1,7908,0,0,0,6609,964],[63,1,8077,0,0,0,7937,0],[65,1,6963,0,0,0,6804,0],[66,1,7664,0,0,0,6230,1106]],"streaming":[[35,1,10788,0,0,0,9443,886],[36,1,9617,0,0,0,8046,1173],[37,1,11079,0,0,0,10164,575],[38,1,9291,0,0,0,8225,747],[39,1,10518,0,0,0,9645,568],[40,1,9439,0,0,0,8190,967],[44,1,8807,0,0,0,7354,1107],[45,1,9585,0